{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_012z3io32Q1SZe1MupAgnZ4A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Here's what was written for **Q17: Golden dataset for evaluation and regression testing?**\n\n**Key content in `05-017-golden-dataset-for-evaluation-and-regression-testing.md`:**\n\n- **Concept:** A golden dataset is a curated, versioned set of (input, expected output) pairs — the LLM equivalent of a unit test suite — used to make eval repeatable and automatable.\n\n- **Mechanism:** 4-step process:\n  1. **Construction** — 150–300 real production queries, stratified to include hard cases and thumbs-downs, labeled by domain experts for both retrieval (relevant chunks) and generation (ideal answers)\n  2. **Metrics** — Recall@5/NDCG on retrieval, RAGAS Faithfulness/Answer Relevancy on generation, LLM-as-judge (1–5 rubric) for holistic quality\n  3. **CI regression gate** — runs on every PR touching prompts/model/retrieval, blocks merge on >3% relative regression vs `main` baseline\n  4. **Refresh cadence** — monthly from thumbs-downs + escalations, JS divergence monitoring for distribution shift, versioned in Git LFS/S3\n\n- **Concrete example:** Embedding model swap (`ada-002` → `text-embedding-3-small`) flagged a 6-point Recall@5 drop in CI before production — fixed and cleared before rollout.\n\n- **Pitfalls highlighted:** Skipping human-labeled ground truth (RAGAS without labels = circular eval), using only synthetic/LLM-generated examples, treating the dataset as static forever, and omitting the retrieval eval layer."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":372,"cache_read_input_tokens":67836,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":372,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b2d8861-0313-4f38-afe4-99a91da8f65a","uuid":"3d5d5095-d24b-4fe2-9c8e-b6c7cd1a8ede"}
